界纪录就是由科杰尔查所保持，他在2024年瓦伦西亚半马跑出了57分30秒的成绩。'}, {'id': 'UTR2026082123046800', 'articletype': '116', 'title': '46秒24！全国夏季游泳锦标赛：潘展乐100自轻松夺冠，5金2银收官', 'pic_style': 0, 'publish_time': '2026-08-23 20:02:28', 'pic_info': {'big_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OD0ZqZR7Jy4T8t6OJ_l2bpuo4qcDHx7ikr6kxFOkdLzvIAA_870492/0'], 'small_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OD0ZqZR7Jy4T8t6OJ_l2bpuo4qcDHx7ikr6kxFOkdLzvIAA_870492/0'], 'three_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OD0ZqZR7Jy4T8t6OJ_l2bpuo4qcDHx7ikr6kxFOkdLzvIAA_870492/0'], 'ext': {}}, 'link_info': {'share_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/UTR2026082123046800', 'url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/UTR2026082123046800', 'short_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/UTR2026082123046800', 'org_url': 'http://view.inews.qq.com/a/UTR2026082123046800'}, 'media_info': {}, 'interation_info': {'comment_id': '339951260821230468', 'read_num': 39936, 'collect_num': 8, 'share_num': 6}, 'doc_info': {}, 'news724_feature': None, 'safe_control': {'close_all_ad': 0, 'close_all_favorite': 0, 'close_all_rel': 0, 'close_share_pull': 0, 'close_relate_thing': 0, 'close_all_emoticon_comment': 0, 'political_option': '', 'pc_not_display': ''}, 'category': None, 'declare': {}, 'pub_info': {}, 'payment_info': {}, 'dislike_options': [{'menu_id': '0', 'menu_name': '不感兴趣', 'menu_items': [{'type': 'dislike_cp', 'name': '不推荐该作者', 'id': '40033'}, {'type': 'dislike_content', 'name': '减少此类内容', 'id': '40022'}]}], 'cp_info': {}, 'flag': {}, 'extra_property': {}, 'share_info': {'share_title': '2026全国夏季游泳锦标赛'}, 'thing_info': {'focus_id': '20260823A0ACWA00'}, 'hot_event': {'id': 'UTR2026082123046800', 'title': '2026全国夏季游泳锦标赛', 'business_type': 'hot_event', 'business_name': '专题', 'event_id': 'eef412a54d70dd742040fd8700d74de9'}}, {'id': '20260823A08NML00', 'articletype': '0', 'title': '世锦赛：凤凰组合1-2不敌吉凯尔/德尔吕摘银，黄东萍无缘大满贯', 'pic_style': 0, 'publish_time': '2026-08-23 17:00:52', 'pic_info': {'big_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/news_ls/OCZRNaLC5TG29dMZPL1ziyBC_4s0b1w0_gYsGsP