完整的贴身服饰生产基地，汕头年产内衣、家居服超50亿件，却长期困于“有工厂无市场”的结构性矛盾，大量优质产品经义乌中转外销，利润被层层分走。现在，局面正在改变。8月18日，汕头市潮阳区谷饶镇，汕头国际纺织城内，“广货行天下·潮品通全球”汕头贴身服饰专场活动举行，汕头贴身服饰交易市场开门迎客。汕头此举被视为学好用好“义乌发展经验”。浙江义乌靠小商品闯出大市场、做成大产业。但“学义乌”并非“复制义乌”。汕头真正想做的，是借商贸重构整条内衣产业链，在价值链上拿回话语权。'}, {'id': '20260823A052XS00', 'articletype': '0', 'title': '比特币跳水，一日8%涨幅归零，加密货币近25万人爆仓', 'pic_style': 0, 'publish_time': '2026-08-23 10:32:16', 'pic_info': {'big_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/O71rhzPvYTzJczddLJeinW1Zs4NLkDEc2SBuaRqa2PYlYAA_870492/0'], 'small_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/O71rhzPvYTzJczddLJeinW1Zs4NLkDEc2SBuaRqa2PYlYAA_294195/0'], 'three_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/O71rhzPvYTzJczddLJeinW1Zs4NLkDEc2SBuaRqa2PYlYAA_197130/0'], 'ls_img_exp_type': '1', 'ext': {'196x130': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/O71rhzPvYTzJczddLJeinW1Zs4NLkDEc2SBuaRqa2PYlYAA_196130/0', '360x240': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/O71rhzPvYTzJczddLJeinW1Zs4NLkDEc2SBuaRqa2PYlYAA_360240/0', '330x330': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/O71rhzPvYTzJczddLJeinW1Zs4NLkDEc2SBuaRqa2PYlYAA_330330/0'}, 'share_img': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/news_ls/OHwJRn71cp3n62ktXfoad7x1KOEfISepMu63Hzjtl2JJAAA_240240/0', 'img_count': 3}, 'link_info': {'share_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260823A052XS00', 'url': 'https://new.qq.com/rain/a/20260823A052XS00', 'short_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260823A052XS00', 'org_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260823A052XS00'}, 'media_info': {'chl_id': '19446188', 'chl_name': '九派财经', 'icon': 'http://inews.gtimg.com/newsapp_ls/0/15002472085/0', 'sicon': 'http://inews.gtimg.com/newsapp_ls/0/15002472085/0', 'mrk': '传递有料有趣的财经资讯，做您身边的财经专家。', 'last_art_update': '0', 'uin': 'ec2490b287851b874549885a5da88e9c58', 'encoded_suid': '8QMf23xU6Y0aujvZ', 'vip_type': '30013', 'vip_type_new': '30013', 'vip_desc': '九派财经官方账号', 'vip_icon': 'http://inews.gtimg.com/newsapp_ls/0/14876049251/0', 'medal_info': {'type_id': 26, 'medal_id': 40, 'medal_level': 1, 'medal_name': '万众瞩目', 'medal_desc': '腾讯新闻粉丝数达到1w', 'night_url': 'http:/