summary': '在国内百万豪车市场，尊界S800绝对称得上是一款现象级的产品。作为一台国产的百万豪车，尊界S800在去年5月上市后单月销量便破千达到1006辆。月销过千台，对于一台普通的车来说可能非常平常，但对于尊界S800这台售价超百万的超豪华行政级轿车来说，这个销量数据是相当牛的。不过，这还只是开始在随后的几个月尊界S800销量稳步增长，巅峰时期是2025年的12月单月销量一度达到了4223辆，在国内百万级行政轿车市场，以绝对优势成为销量冠军。'}, {'id': '20260822V0BUPT00', 'articletype': '4', 'title': '30万级，奔驰和宝马已经大变样', 'pic_style': 4, 'publish_time': '2026-08-22 22:46:31', 'pic_info': {'big_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OMmGIvfqyhZief1EH7zHMhc1Qctk4F_rUmu9eQlQG1OnsAA_870492/0'], 'small_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OMmGIvfqyhZief1EH7zHMhc1Qctk4F_rUmu9eQlQG1OnsAA_294195/0'], 'three_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/news_ls/OxcM2UIt4MTRA1D8PFxDBFxAMdbfU3xxaYxZBN2WFRrsQAA_150120/0'], 'ext': {'640x360': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OMmGIvfqyhZief1EH7zHMhc1Qctk4F_rUmu9eQlQG1OnsAA_640360/0', '196x130': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OMmGIvfqyhZief1EH7zHMhc1Qctk4F_rUmu9eQlQG1OnsAA_196130/0', '330x330': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OMmGIvfqyhZief1EH7zHMhc1Qctk4F_rUmu9eQlQG1OnsAA_330330/0', '480x640': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OMmGIvfqyhZief1EH7zHMhc1Qctk4F_rUmu9eQlQG1OnsAA_480640/0'}, 'share_img': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/news_ls/O5g2Q8eciBJDa_66ubRgPhNSMtaG5jA8PAqv9WQYFfvwQAA_240240/0', 'aspect': '0.56', 'pic_first': 'https://puui.qpic.cn/vpic_cover/o1284hqge3h/o1284hqge3h_first.jpg/720'}, 'link_info': {'share_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260822V0BUPT00', 'url': 'https://new.qq.com/rain/a/20260822V0BUPT00', 'short_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260822V0BUPT00', 'org_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260822V0BUPT00'}, 'media_info': {'chl_id': '5448712', 'chl_name': '这车值么', 'icon': 'http://inews.gtimg.com/newsapp_ls/0/14589348822_200200/0', 'sicon': 'http://inews.gtimg.com/newsapp_ls/0/14589348822_200200/0', 'mrk': '这车值不值？老任说了算！选车、买车、用车、玩车，就看《这车值么》！', 'last_art_update': '0', 'uin': 'ec1d81324884df0a08577a2c32d4a7de76', 'encoded_suid': '8QMc3X1b6IcVujjc', 'vip_type': '30011', 'vip_type_new': '30011', 'vip_desc': '汽车领域创作者', 'vip_icon': 'http://inews.